Subject: [PATCH 22/23] fix: use Radix DropdownMenu portal for player action
 menu

Replace custom absolute-positioned dropdown with Radix DropdownMenu
which renders via portal to document.body. This prevents the dropdown
from being clipped by ancestor overflow:hidden containers in the
server layout.

diff --git a/resources/scripts/components/server/players/PlayerActionMenu.tsx b/resources/scripts/components/server/players/PlayerActionMenu.tsx
